{"game": "back-4-blood", "language": "schinese", "appid": 924970, "month": "2021-11", "window": 1, "start_date": 1635724800, "end_date": 1636415999, "month_true_total": 2312, "quota": 47, "returned": 47, "pulled_at": "2026-08-29 21:03:30 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "102457980", "author": {"steamid": "76561198080310738", "personaname": "#Killy", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/494128969/", "num_games_owned": 188, "num_reviews": 27, "playtime_forever": 7973, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5124, "last_played": 1755957951, "avatar": "c4c822cc494b78b6f1bb2a57dbb472499306d3a1"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "别拿价格问题给差评了弟弟们，求生之路09年正版售价45刀。", "timestamp_created": 1636413172, "timestamp_updated": 1636413172, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.519783198833465576", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102451282", "author": {"steamid": "76561198021367780", "personaname": "sugar", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Satou_/", "num_games_owned": 70, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1538, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1509, "last_played": 1651173661, "avatar": "b1ede6e96e0e761189caff764d086b034d8266f1"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "♥♥♥♥", "timestamp_created": 1636401688, "timestamp_updated": 1636401688, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 7, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.560076892375946045", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": true, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102449537", "author": {"steamid": "76561198816375586", "personaname": "C.C.C.P", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198816375586/", "num_games_owned": 37, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 2085, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1093, "last_played": 1774274524, "avatar": "3f5e9daea59216d7fe13df4e031d3537580e5e21"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "老是掉线，玩你嘛呢！", "timestamp_created": 1636398965, "timestamp_updated": 1636398965, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 14, "votes_funny": 3, "weighted_vote_score": "0.638531744480133057", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102448390", "author": {"steamid": "76561198096549688", "personaname": "白小韩", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198096549688/", "num_games_owned": 171, "num_reviews": 39, "playtime_forever": 19179, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12213, "last_played": 1739819303, "avatar": "3f5e9daea59216d7fe13df4e031d3537580e5e21"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "内容少，新兵过于简单，老兵属于简单模式，噩梦还行很离谱。噩梦才是这游戏的乐趣，作为独狼玩家，噩梦依靠跑酷过的，现在已经两个特种皮肤，但已经玩腻了。\n————————————————————————分割线\n一两个月过去了，我从萌新一直到最早期获得特种皮肤的人，带了各种群里一批有一批萌新过噩梦。因为太过于无聊所以在一个月之前退坑了，一直到前几天我遇到了她，让我重新玩起这游戏，确实之前一直是独狼玩家，玩什么都是独狼，都只想自己玩得舒服一点，所以比较杀得血腥眼红，为了好的战绩为了赢不择手段。很开心，我遇到了一个年轻漂亮的姑娘，她也喜欢玩steam，我们认识是在全民K歌的心动对唱上，说起来也是很那啥，她说我唱歌好听，她不敢唱，然后我又故意说绕口令“八百标兵奔北坡”，互相哈哈大笑后加了微信就这样慢慢在一起了。现在喜欢带她玩各种各样的游戏。\n这一款喋血复仇原本她不喜欢恐怖的，但是有我这种大神带也没那么恐怖了哈哈哈哈，当然我玩那个“抓鬼游戏”也会吓尿，尽管是两个人一起玩。好游戏，如果你有朋友的话。好游戏，如果你有对象的话。好游戏，如果你是独狼的话，独狼玩家最好还是跑酷。\n——————————————————————————————\nTMGB，WDNMD,他们把跑酷卡大砍了一刀，那你还出你M的跑酷卡呢，你直接删了不行？你那点加强枪械卡有卵用，近战也砍了，血吸不上来了总感觉，跑到飞砍得太NM 离谱，被怪碰到减速12的时候，你根本跑不动，减速是你的总体百分之12，加只是加了12，草！所以被群怪碰了只有死，那我跑NM。", "timestamp_created": 1636397210, "timestamp_updated": 1640228569, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102447460", "author": {"steamid": "76561198096970122", "personaname": "失忆复建", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198096970122/", "num_games_owned": 62, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 36038, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3120, "last_played": 1781966423, "avatar": "2561438f3b28fa92991745461300d5b25a5b5ec0"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "砍！", "timestamp_created": 1636395774, "timestamp_updated": 1636395774, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102445194", "author": {"steamid": "76561198380876072", "personaname": "Mecree", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198380876072/", "num_games_owned": 101, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 5090, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4059, "last_played": 1736691444, "avatar": "a521352ec938d97a89f4b9655f75924d3cea6344"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "爽就完事了", "timestamp_created": 1636392067, "timestamp_updated": 1636392067, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102444143", "author": {"steamid": "76561199151830174", "personaname": "喋血复仇09", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "h