00", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102440650", "author": {"steamid": "76561198411348609", "personaname": "愿与愁", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198411348609/", "num_games_owned": 42, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 2281, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 337, "last_played": 1659163612, "avatar": "148ff422f2245ab66abfeabf3f7506861d6b703b"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "台湾省，香港特别行政区，澳门特别行政区，藏南地区，钓鱼岛及其附属岛屿，南沙群岛，阿塞克钦地区，洞朗地区等都是我国不可分割的领土，任何胆敢分裂我国的反动势力都将会被我国的钢铁洪流碾为齑粉！\n中国万岁！人民万岁！共产主义万岁！\n", "timestamp_created": 1636385371, "timestamp_updated": 1636385371, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.496183186769485474", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102439312", "author": {"steamid": "76561198305362072", "personaname": "城市的光", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198305362072/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 27591, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7099, "last_played": 1718511608, "avatar": "b135000e1247a148c55463730099e00a78714164"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "好玩就完了！", "timestamp_created": 1636383383, "timestamp_updated": 1636383383, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102437316", "author": {"steamid": "76561198841431672", "personaname": "lordking", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198841431672/", "num_games_owned": 13, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 26037, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 597, "last_played": 1738676450, "avatar": "bfe75d9f1526dbf76072fbc6cae8d42c2b7ce8be"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "好", "timestamp_created": 1636380449, "timestamp_updated": 1636380449, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102434232", "author": {"steamid": "76561198102159396", "personaname": "Fylgie", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198102159396/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 34658, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 3286, "playtime_at_review": 2249, "last_played": 1788010534, "avatar": "4d7be337ecd991347c3d3a8ec04efb17517e25b2"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "求求你们放单机玩家一条活路，哪怕东西少点呢，现在上班族哪里能叫到稳定打的伙伴，就想下班打打僵尸爽一下都不行，单人模式通关之后就没用了，所以花这么多钱就一遍流程，图什么啊，这方面设计的真是垃圾到家了，想单机玩的别买了，这个游戏是网游，想自由匹配又慢还得担心遇到坑", "timestamp_created": 1636375526, "timestamp_updated": 1636375526, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102433548", "author": {"steamid": "76561198113900123", "personaname": "sky_tiger", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198113900123/", "num_games_owned": 319, "num_reviews": 35, "playtime_forever": 8548, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7113, "last_played": 1711272578, "avatar": "4da89a145aae236cfc2cc6c2221eb63c372b2326"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "===21年11月10日更新===\n看看这制作组今儿更新了什么，近战卡太强啦我们来砍一刀（砍近战攻击力、回蓝血变回红血、近战效能少三分之一）。玩家金币怎么这么多不行少拿点（金钱至上加3最多75）并且觉得一个pve游戏，野队老兵都经常翻车的情况还不够他们的预想，接着强化特感\n\n合着您是特感的制作组，员工都是丧尸是吧？\n\nDLC，今年莫的啦~\n新人物，明年再说~\n新地图，就一张噢！\n\n我可去您的吧~！\n\nL4D2十年了，现在月活都还保持两万多，您这刚发售一个月的游戏现在峰值好像也就两万出头？真的心里面一点逼数没有？诚然我只是一个普普通通的玩家，但你给我的，我全数记着，差评拿好。\n\n298，这拿去预定老头环不比给司马制作组好一万倍？？？\n\n\n====================\n\n如果你没有朋友一起玩，这游戏完全完全对不起298的价格。如果你有愿意跟你一起玩的朋友，那这个游戏可以给你提供至少五六十小时的游玩时间。因为不多花点时间打不过去啊~~~如果这游戏卖两百块，那我可以打个八十分。\n\n制作组的态度我觉得已经算明显了，就是为了打着求生原班人马的噱头，做个不算差的东西赶紧回笼一波资金。从发售到现在，他有更新过什么东西吗？补丁打了几个？？别说新内容了，原本的bug都没有修！！！发售的一个月黄金时间，这制作组毛线正事没干，你就能懂他们的态度了。\n\n连续后坐力bug\n第一枪子弹消失bug\n换关副武器子弹消失bug\n货轮关bug\n换弹bug\n一堆bug。更别说其他影响游玩体验的地方——更气人的是你知道他原本能做到！\n\n上弹动作，只有一套空仓换弹，以至于每次换弹都要拉栓，极大影响射击手感\n配件不可拆卸，又不能存，明摆着让你撞运气捡啥用啥\n难度数值不平衡，这老兵和噩梦之间少了个军官吧？\n看着有四个大关，实际地图重复率快有一半，同个小镇封个路改个道噢哟又是一个新关卡啦！制作组：我们还有迷雾卡，停电卡，给你不同的体验！\n赶工作品缺少内容被你们修饰的挺好听啊！！！\n\n……种种种种无一不在声明，这是个缺乏细节，缺乏打磨的作品，也就组卡还有点乐趣，比方喷子带提升准确度的卡，100%准确度变成独头狙；奶妈带点近战卡，上能砍大哥下能奶队友；润卡组就不说了。", "timestamp_created": 1636374288, "timestamp_updated": 1636529428, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 1, "weighted_vote_score": "0.504909992218017578", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102432761", "author": {"steamid": "76561198109859307", "personaname": "原神高手", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198109859307/", "num_games_owned": 175, "num_reviews": 19, "playtime_forever": 11925, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8001, "last_played": 1671263975, "avatar": "f35055d38f49d970163672f92cdde98b5bdb9b42"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "当跑酷成为主流，这个游戏的设计就是失败的；\n前期少卡导致难度曲线到后期逐渐下滑，应当与游戏设计者的思路相反；\n我想大多数人宁可提高收益并且让怪更强，而不是比老兵更少的物资，紧巴巴的扣着每一分钱过日子。\n一句话总结噩梦难度：坐牢，坐牢就算了，牢里的饭是屎\n", "timestamp_created": 1636372779, "timestamp_updated": 1636372779, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 114, "votes_funny": 21, "weighted_vote_score": "0.817406892776489258", "comment_count": 3, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 15, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "102429624", "author": {"steamid": "76561198010615348", "personaname": "My11", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198010615348/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 66, "playtime_forever": 14328, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5736, "last_played": 1706884322, "avatar": "8f6916be3dcc60a0c3e9391276bce389a138b83a"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "游戏内容先不说，动不动就未响应、服务器连接失败，体验贼差", "timestamp_created": 1636366255, "timestamp_updated": 1636366255, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102428249", "author": {"steamid": "76561198168004681", "personaname": "麋鹿S", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198168004681/", "num_games_owned": 221, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 14061, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 8779, "last_played": 1719775891, "avatar": "5b8825b34c5d77b00c3a18897f2f1175fa0e0e57"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "写在最前面。玩nm，各位xgp8块畅玩一个月，别花钱买。\n下面的是我之前的好评，仅限于10号更新之前，真是给咱一个好惊喜啊，你要说你觉得噩梦以下近战一带三太猛了想削弱一下增加点体验感咱觉得也行，没啥问题，减点伤害减点耐力得了呗，就非得直接砍死不让玩了？地推nm啊地推，跑就得了，反正bug多的是，随便测测又出来两个跑酷专用bug。诶就是不地推，就是跑，不光自己想跑你们逼着跑，老兵测试卡组轮船拉补给箱第二个箱子刚开完你让破坏者从特么车子底下出来？哪个脑子有问题的程序员写出来的狗屎东西？四个人看前面你从后面车底下钻出来是吧，破坏者诶大哥，他妈的从车子底下钻出来？？？？什么狗屎刷新机制越改越离谱。\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\n游戏时长就算150吧，目前体验我个人感觉不错，噩梦通了两次（但是bug或者因为我倒地成就未解锁？）\n这游戏最大的败笔就是特感刷新机制和枪械配件无法拆卸机制，其余我都感觉还好，\n但是他的特感刷新让人捉摸不透（跑酷流觉得很赞并且点了一个踩）\n如果你有三个朋友，刚好他们也都入了这个游戏，刚好你们喜欢挑战高难度，恭喜你们，发现了宝藏（时间消失器与心态鉴定器）\n但如果你只有一个人玩，你还不喜欢高难度，快退款，真的，快点退款宝贝，等打折在入手吧，或者xgp玩一玩就得了。\n以上。", "timestamp_created": 1636363110, "timestamp_updated": 1636643854, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.545454561710357666", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 13, "count": 1}]}, {"recommendationid": "102426725", "author": {"steamid": "76561198433832775", "personaname": "FYM", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198433832775/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 4135, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2062, "last_played": 1687866582, "avatar": "ee0e6adb9c075b0b40cbedba2f8699d1c040ca6c"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "好玩到我没话说，我只能玩改装车了，3H气动避震，加车体手工宽体，加定制前唇，加定制前后杠，定制风刀，碳纤尾翼，全段FGK排气，3片锻造轮毂，PS4高性能轮胎，改装车这么好玩，我玩个吊游戏！！", "timestamp_created": 1636359562, "timestamp_updated": 1636359562, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102425607", "author": {"steamid": "76561198321960318", "personaname": "Jet2holiday", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/pineapple27/", "num_games_owned": 180, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 207, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 207, "last_played": 1634649557, "avatar": "b6e930ca24286f2d0e55c960ca510369a884626f"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "买了就后悔，垃圾卖这么贵，还不如去玩L4D2", "timestamp_created": 1636356820, "timestamp_updated": 1636356820, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.495839118957519531", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102423667", "author": {"steamid": "76561198072758525", "personaname": "Naker13", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198072758525/", "num_games_owned": 479, "num_reviews": 59, "playtime_forever": 10087, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 4442, "last_played": 1669695722, "avatar": "7f18826cde601ab69f29cb088793af9cbd1ccc14"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "让我打狙指定嘎嘎乱杀", "timestamp_created": 1636352004, "timestamp_updated": 1644527247, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "102423052", "author": {"steamid": "76561198022153420", "personaname": "魔动闪霸", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198022153420/", "num_games_owned": 101, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 1316, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 644, "last_played": 1699886006, "avatar": "d5600f93c830be2024aa5ff077a4edc713cc7e3d"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "EDG NB", "timestamp_created": 1636350442, "timestamp_updated": 1636350442, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.513342976570129395", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck":